    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose guri báy, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Slahhángw geera bál bar wak heémár Mungú ka kikí'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng daqaní sandakmooduú alqado ku baraadií dahás, nee inqwaarír kur geehhaantes ka tareeré'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee meésa ka dahás nee xoslu ki amohhe'és gawaawósií ale. Nee kitángw tsaa'aso ku dahás sleeme, daqaní tsaa'aso ka gawaawós i qás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng kitangwduú sahaábu oo mooyángw tsuú' kuwa da/a/an ku qás geeraá sandakmooduú alqado, daqaní inqwaari ka tareeré' afkú heémár Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng sleeme kitángw ilahhooa kawa da/aa/an ku qás geeraá didá' hhoohhoo' ar heémár Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee iimpeedár hamtlo ka qás tla/ángw heémár Mungú nee kitángw ilahhooa kay da/a/an, ma'aywo dala/eek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daqaní koo/ír afeena ka sihhtís bihhe sleémeero nee afkú dahma ku inqwaarír i tareeré'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Aluuwo heémár Mungú nee umuúqo gár baraawósí diriia nee xosluuwós sleémeero ka parátl, ar kawa iimbalax ar di/tá iimbalaxaangw, umuúqo gaaro iri hhoohhoouúr. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuúng kitangwduú ilahhooár da/a/aangw nee xoslu sleémeero ki parátl nee ki iimbaláx ar di/i, daqaní i kángw kilá' wa hhohhooúy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimpeedár hamtlo nee kitaangose ki parátl nee ki iimbaláx di/to.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Aluuwo Aroni nee daaqaywose ngi húp ay dír afkú heémár Mungú, daqaní inooín ki ma'ár hamátl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daqaní Aroni ku tsiitís tlabaadá' hhohhoe nee ku iimbaláx di/to as kuwa paratl, as kahhó' tawa kaahamusmoó Mungú. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daaqaywós ngu húp sleeme ki tsiitís hiyi'i. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki iimbaláx di/to adór baabuúín ar ale, as kahhó' inooín tawa kaahamuusér Mungú. Iimbalaaxar'ín tisíng gin dahás baraá gadiyér kaahamuusi'iima ay qari sleémeero.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose adoodá' sleémeero AAKOÓ MUNGÚ aa hara'ayín gari tleéhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Slahhángw geera tawa wak oo kurkú tsár alaá inooín tindiwa yaamaá Misrír wa ti'iít, heémadár Mungú kari kikií'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose yukuma'aá uheemi ki sihhin giri qaás, peehhoó ngir gáwtí oohi guri qaás, guri muqslár tseék, uheemi giri sihhtís, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "heéma gari gáwtá wa hhaáf, inqwaaridá' tsiiriihh gari tuuntukumár wa qaás ar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose ngura ádbáy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tlaa/eedá' parereehhayen awa tsár awa hara'ayár koomá' giri qaás baraá sandakmo, xaaidá' sandakmo kur loohisi giri qaás baraá dungáydá', kitangwduú gurtleemu guri gawaá daanduú sandakmoó i qaás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sandakmoodá' guri dahaás baraá guruú heéma, inqwaari gari tarereé', nee inqwaaridá' sandakmoodá' guri gehhaantés ar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose ngura ádbáy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meésa gari dahaás baraá guruú heémaadá', gari qaás bihhaá /iikú wa ale daanduú tsee/a oo inqwaaridá' taa sandakmór gehhanteés. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá daanduú meésaadae mikaáteédá' taa Mungú i haniís gari qoomeés, ar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose ngura ádbáy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós kitángw tsaa'aso guri dahaás baraá guruú heéma bihhaá basa, ti afiqoná' nee meésaadá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsaa'aso gari qaás gawaá kitaangw dír geeraá AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose ngura ádbáy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós kitangwduú sahaábu oo ilahhooár mooyángw tsuú', guri dahaás guruú heéma, guri qaás daanduú tsee/a oo inqwaaridá' sandakmo gwa geehhaantes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee ilahhooár mooyángw tsuú' guri gawaadá' i daá/ ar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose ngura ádbáy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós afkú heémaadár Mungú guri inqwaarírí tarereé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitángw ilahhooár da/a/aangw gari qaás dír afkú heémadár Mungú, ilahhooár da/a gari gawaadá' wa haniís nee ilahhooár balaango, ar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose ngura ádbáy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimpér hamtlo gari qaás tla/ángw heémaadár Mungú nee kitángw ilahhooa, ma'aá hamtlo giri baraadií qaás. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose nee Aroni nee daaqoó Aroniwo dabaaín nee ya'aaine ngin baraadií hamtliitiyá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár inooín birna dahiyé' baraá heémár Mungú, nee qoomár kitángw ilahhooa burku i tseewúy, aqo nin hamtliná' ar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ Mose ngura ádbáy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Mose koo/idá' afeenír heéma gaa harwet nee kitángw ilahhooaro giri qaás, nee afkú dahmaá baraá afeeni guri inqwaarírí tarereé'. Gawaá adoorihe Mose gadiyeé sleémeero gari hhe'eés.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo huunki heémadár Mungú gari tuuntúk, nee xirfuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ heémadá' gari dalaá/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose dahmaá baraá heémár Mungú gari harslaaqaát, asma huunkidá' i gawaá daanduú heémaadá' nee xirfuú AAKOÓ MUNGÚ heéma gaa dalaá/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár huunkidá' barka ar tláy gawaá daanduú heémaro, múk Israeli in kumiit aaii'ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala barnaxes huunkidá' kaa hingeesiiká inooín i kumitiaaká aiiwo, aqo kan dán ay bál kay hingeesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 40:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma huunkirír AAKOÓ MUNGÚ qoomár tlaatla/ango in gawaá heémadá' i dirí', nee ala xweeraawo asla in baraawós wa gwa/át, múk Israeli sleémeero huunkidá' kana ga/aa/áy baraá aaii'ín sleémeero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.40.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.40.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
